<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris Open semifinal results on</p>
<p>Saturday (prexix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Petr Korda (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>3-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
